    },
    {
      "id": "HDeiGOKTdLcISZTC6_SAF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -250.78827351735475,
      "y": 1169.91158277302,
      "width": 205.6821746826172,
      "height": 17.325539295638503,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1901434262,
      "version": 127,
      "versionNonce": 682145482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606400964,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原子级别的成像：可以“看到原子”",
      "fontSize": 13.860431436510803,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原子级别的成像：可以“看到原子”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j39bfhTHhD8Y5gCYMqhHQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -250.78827351735475,
      "y": 1189.2814610324695,
      "width": 304.99877684094827,
      "height": 34.651078591277006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 477786838,
      "version": 139,
      "versionNonce": 1421561226,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606400964,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "科学家可以用 扫描隧道显微镜（STM） 拍出原子\n一个个排成阵列的照片。",
      "fontSize": 13.860431436510803,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "科学家可以用 扫描隧道显微镜（STM） 拍出原子一个个排成阵列的照片。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LAu_8tiD1zWwhlX7mYC61",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -250.78827351735475,
      "y": 1225.9768785875574,
      "width": 291.0596923828125,
      "height": 17.325539295638503,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1636935702,
      "version": 146,
      "versionNonce": 2009926730,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606400964,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "比如：在金属表面上看到排列整齐的原子点阵。",
      "fontSize": 13.860431436510803,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "比如：在金属表面上看到排列整齐的原子点阵。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MjDMVJ_7tgPc5g6RBsZML",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -250.78827351735475,
      "y": 1245.3467568470069,
      "width": 303.2246221596821,
      "height": 34.651078591277006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 9450838,
      "version": 168,
      "versionNonce": 934867722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606400964,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "甚至可以用 STM 推动单个原子 来拼图（IBM 就\n拼过 “IBM” 这三个字母）。",
      "fontSize": 13.860431436510803,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "甚至可以用 STM 推动单个原子 来拼图（IBM 就拼过 “IBM” 这三个字母）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c3izOREeaKo8k4MGduCyg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -250.78827351735475,
      "y": 1282.042174402095,
      "width": 300.90995379704555,
      "height": 34.651078591277006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1925913238,
      "version": 198,
      "versionNonce": 1190789578,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606400964,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这是真实“看到”的意义——不是计算模拟，而是通\n过电子隧穿电流直接反映出原子的形状和位置。",
      "fontSize": 13.860431436510803,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这是真实“看到”的意义——不是计算模拟，而是通过电子隧穿电流直接反映出原子的形状和位置。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
