      "text": "看不见",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "看不见",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u02q9tqvCt4dlUgfHFA1A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 284.21595791934743,
      "y": 1345.7480695309137,
      "width": 209.7520837757718,
      "height": 17.325539295638503,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1838135446,
      "version": 402,
      "versionNonce": 1858280010,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606400969,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "只能间接推测（粒子加速器实验）",
      "fontSize": 13.860431436510803,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "只能间接推测（粒子加速器实验）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1-kJGAXZVL6Y-wSeDDfff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141.61717646427928,
      "y": 1193.3969633995482,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1937257942,
      "version": 424,
      "versionNonce": 642385750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606400969,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "比如说粒子对撞直接穿过去代表是空心的，垂直反弹回来代表是实心的，如果散开来代表介于两者之间\n如果撞的乱七八糟的，那就证明这个被撞粒子内部是很乱的，那就没有办法了那就只能多撞然后根据\n反弹到到不同地方的概率来推测(我猜是这样来研究的)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "比如说粒子对撞直接穿过去代表是空心的，垂直反弹回来代表是实心的，如果散开来代表介于两者之间\n如果撞的乱七八糟的，那就证明这个被撞粒子内部是很乱的，那就没有办法了那就只能多撞然后根据\n反弹到到不同地方的概率来推测(我猜是这样来研究的)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
